{
  "title": "RPO / RTO · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "허용 가능한 데이터 손실과 서비스 중단 시간으로 복구 전략을 정합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>RPO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Point Objective)</span> / RTO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Time Objective)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#guide-1\">복구 목표를 구성으로 바꾸기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#guide-2\">대표적인 복구 전략</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>44 / 62</span></div><h1>RPO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Point Objective)</span> / RTO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Time Objective)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>재해 복구는 <strong>큰 장애가 발생한 뒤 데이터를 되살리고 서비스를 다시 제공하는 계획</strong>입니다. 어느 시점의 데이터까지 복구해야 하는지와 얼마나 빨리 서비스를 재개해야 하는지를 먼저 정합니다.</p><p><strong>RPO</strong>는 허용 가능한 데이터 손실을 시간으로 표현한 목표이고, <strong>RTO</strong>는 서비스 복구까지 허용할 시간입니다. 목표가 엄격할수록 복제와 대기 환경에 더 많은 준비가 필요합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"recovery-point-objective\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"recovery-time-objective\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backup-and-restore\"></span><h2>복구 목표를 구성으로 바꾸기</h2><p>백업 시점 사이의 변경을 잃어도 된다면 정기 백업을 활용할 수 있습니다. 데이터 손실을 더 줄여야 한다면 복제와 복구 가능한 시점을 고려합니다.</p><p>복구 시간이 충분하면 장애 후 서버를 새로 만들 수 있습니다. 빠른 재개가 필요하면 핵심 시스템이나 전체 서비스를 미리 준비해둡니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"pilot-light\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"warm-standby\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"multi-site-active-active\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"failover-failback-and-testing\"></span><h2>대표적인 복구 전략</h2><p><strong>백업·복원</strong>은 데이터를 보관하고 필요할 때 환경을 복구합니다. <strong>파일럿 라이트</strong>는 핵심 요소를 유지하고, <strong>웜 스탠바이</strong>는 축소된 서비스 전체를 준비해둡니다.</p><p>여러 위치에서 동시에 처리하는 액티브-액티브 방식은 빠른 대응을 목표로 하지만 데이터 일관성과 운영 복잡성을 고려해야 합니다. 어떤 방식이든 정기 훈련과 원복<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 절차가 필요합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>복구 전략 결정 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>RPO</strong><span>얼마나 최근 데이터가 필요한가</span></li><li><strong>RTO</strong><span>얼마나 빨리 재개해야 하나</span></li><li><strong>복구 구성</strong><span>백업·복제·대기 용량</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">목표를 먼저 정한 뒤 비용과 복잡성을 감당할 수 있는 구성을 선택합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>데이터 손실을 짧게 제한해야 하는 주문 시스템은 다른 리전으로 데이터를 복제하고 축소된 서비스 환경을 유지합니다. 훈련으로 확장과 접속 전환에 걸리는 시간을 측정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>원복</strong> — 복구 환경에서 서비스를 운영한 뒤 원래 환경으로 되돌리는 과정입니다. 그동안 변경된 데이터의 반영과 사용자 연결 전환을 포함합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/plan-for-disaster-recovery-dr.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plan for Disaster Recovery (DR) ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q001\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q004\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q023\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q078\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,2\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q093\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">이전 용어 <b>Route Table</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">다음 용어 <b>S3</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
